WEBVTT

00:23:26.913 --> 00:23:30.913
And is your hope that we continue seeing
those as feminine qualities

00:23:30.913 --> 00:23:34.704
or that we dismantle these stereotypes
at the at the ground level

00:23:34.704 --> 00:23:36.788
and say actually these are
leadership qualities?

00:23:37.704 --> 00:23:40.496
I don't know, I've never
thought about that,

00:23:40.496 --> 00:23:42.704
so I couldn't I couldn't
possibly answer it,

00:23:42.704 --> 00:23:47.329
but what I love is he was
one of the chiefs of

00:23:47.329 --> 00:23:51.913
a Latin American indigenous tribe,
and I forget which country.

00:23:52.454 --> 00:23:55.829
But he said to me, he said,
you know, Jane,

00:23:56.038 --> 00:23:59.288
we consider our tribe as like an eagle.

00:23:59.996 --> 00:24:04.329
And on this eagle, one wing is male
and the other wing is female.